 ## [Unreleased]
+### Added
+- Added a structured warning log emitted when a Check request for a userset user returns `false` and the request shape matches a known v1→v2 resolution divergence (self-referential usersets, alias usersets, computed usersets targeting the same object, and tuple-to-userset usersets). The log includes the store ID, model ID, request ID, and a `reason` field identifying the detected scenario, helping operators spot potential breaking changes when adopting the experimental `weighted_graph_check` algorithm.
 
